msgstr ""

msgid "For example, rolling 4 and then 6 gives you ten turn points. Banking saves those ten and ends your turn. Rolling 1 instead loses the ten. If you roll 2 before that 1, you still lose the ten turn points, but keep the two points that went straight into your bank."
