#: games/domino.rb:157
msgid "Normally one teammate emptying their hand wins the round for the team. That team scores zero. Every other team adds its own remaining hand values and also the tiles still held by the winning team's partners. If the round blocks, each team counts only its own hands. Count the special 0/0 rule separately in each hand, not across the whole team."
