msgstr ""

msgid "The Auction pile is shuffled to make up a new draw pile, and its cards are auctioned one at a time. The active player turns the top card face up. The player after the active one must either bid at least 1 or pass, and then, in turn order, every other player either bids or passes."
msgstr ""

