msgstr ""

msgid "Two to eight players receive seven cards. Choose the classic, No Mercy or Flip deck. The remaining cards form the draw pile and one ordinary card begins the discard pile."
msgstr ""

msgid "Two to eight players receive seven cards. The remaining cards form the draw pile and one ordinary card begins the discard pile."
